---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-brand-ivory relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle decorative shapes -->
  <div class="absolute -right-32 top-12 w-96 h-96 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/10 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      
      <!-- Asymmetric Left Side Column - Overlapping Images -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative group">
        <!-- Background frame -->
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 border border-brand-gold/30 rounded-sm translate-x-4 translate-y-4 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:translate-y-2"></div>
        
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm aspect-[3/4] shadow-md bg-brand-gold/10">
          <img 
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511795409834-ef04bbd61622?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" 
            alt="Sagar Soni Weddings Legacy Decor Setup" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transform scale-102 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-charcoal/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Floating badge detailing 20+ Years -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 sm:-bottom-8 sm:-right-8 bg-brand-charcoal border border-brand-gold text-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-sm shadow-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
          <span class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-brand-gold font-bold">20+</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold-light mt-1">Years of Legacy</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Side Column - Editorial Copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold mb-3 block">Our Heritage</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif tracking-wide text-brand-charcoal">
            A Legacy of *Grandeur* & Trust
          </h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-[1px] bg-brand-gold mt-4"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Founder Quote -->
        <div class="border-l-2 border-brand-gold pl-6 py-1">
          <p class="font-serif-italic text-lg sm:text-xl text-brand-charcoal italic">
            "Where service starts before the event."
          </p>
          <cite class="not-italic text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold-dark mt-2 block">
            — Sagar Soni, Founder
          </cite>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-brand-charcoal-light font-light text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Established in 2000 in Raipur, Chhattisgarh, **Sagar Soni Weddings & Catering Services** began with a simple philosophy: to provide royal-standard celebration facilities customized for every family's budget. Over the last two decades, that philosophy has transformed us into Central India's premier wedding planning agency.
          </p>
          <p>
            We manage weddings as a fine art. From complex multi-day indoor and outdoor catering setups to breathtaking theme designs and high-fidelity entertainment coordinates, our signature touch is woven into every single moment. We have executed over **1,500+ celebrations**, establishing a reputation for uncompromising hospitality and seamless execution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Founder Core Values Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4 border-t border-brand-gold/15">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold block mb-2">The Golden Rule</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal-light/90 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Bespoke luxury arrangements engineered within your budget. No compromises.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold block mb-2">Raipur Heart</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal-light/90 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Deep roots in Chhattisgarh culture, handling traditional ceremonies with royal reverence.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
